		}
		{
			dependencies: ["58A76179A3648724"]
			description: ["The UIV emitter, sensor, field generator, robot arm, conveyor module, pump, piston and motor are the parts of this era. The circuit assembler, the hatches and the controllers past them are built from these. The UEV part of the same kind (two for the motor, pump and field generator), plus UIV circuits of any kind from the optical mainframe. The motor also takes metallic hydrogen cable, windings and superconducting coils; the pump takes RHEA impellers and plates; the emitter takes two gamma laser cavities. The UIV circuit assembler and the UIV hatches. Stock each part by ME; a controller draws several of the same kind."]
			icon: "gtceu:uiv_electric_pump"
			id: "17C0F46C21B9CD13"
			rewards: [{ id: "366424FA6A7C7F5A", type: "xp", xp: 120 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1AA68077E0F69895", item: "gtceu:uiv_emitter", type: "item" }
