			y: 53.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["302777116673DBF1"]
			description: ["Protons on nitrogen-15 are the hottest fuel and give the most current per ring. The ash is carbon-12, which the diamond lines take. Polarised ammonia ice pellets and a ring with the full set of hatches. The strongest Mk5 source, and the carbon for diamond. Send the carbon-12 straight to the diamond lattice fab."]
			icon: "gtceu:pn15_plasma_bucket"
			id: "16B25F9750E5C09E"
			rewards: [{ id: "3239BCCB3D2A89CB", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7A5A84CB7D154A19", item: "gtceu:pn15_plasma_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Nitrogen Burn"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 53.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["16B25F9750E5C09E"]
			description: ["The &6Direct Energy Converter&r takes the three Mk5 plasmas as new recipes. Its output is final: a generator array does not double it. The converter from ZPM and a plasma line for each burn. Mk5 power for the hatches and the wireless network. Plasma by pipe from the ring; keep the converter's hatches free of anything else."]
			icon: "gtceu:direct_energy_converter"
			id: "360709C0A42E7094"
			rewards: [{ id: "592BB1C698306BA7", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7BEF3B769EB21ECE", item: "gtceu:direct_energy_converter", type: "item" }]
			title: "Plasma to Current"
			x: 16.0d
			y: 53.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["17B06879E2354DD6"]
			description: ["The &6Insane Parallel Control Hatch&r lets a mega machine run more copies of a recipe at once than the UEV one. Energy is still the limit: every copy pays its own EU/t. A machine with a parallel slot and the power for every copy. Wide runs on the Neutronium Compression Hall and the other mega machines. Feed the machine a bus wide enough for the copies it runs."]
			icon: "gtceu:uiv_parallel_hatch"
			id: "36B8D9937001B17B"
			rewards: [{ id: "533D3582C8F64093", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "5C00DDA87A1C0F57", item: "gtceu:uiv_parallel_hatch", type: "item" }]
			title: "Parallel Control"
			x: 9.0d
			y: 35.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["17B06879E2354DD6"]
			description: ["The &6UIV SMES Cell&r holds four times what the UEV cell does, in metallic hydrogen wire. The Nitride Magnet Works from UEV: four UEV SMES cells, metallic hydrogen single wire and helium. The UIV wireless tier. Nothing to feed. Size the towers for your busiest hour."]
			icon: "grindless:uiv_smes_cell"
			id: "5FB006B879741A02"
			rewards: [{ id: "34D47AB6E85C7F74", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "58CF3B6EE938CE16", item: "grindless:uiv_smes_cell", type: "item" }]
			title: "The UIV Cell"
			x: 9.0d
			y: 37.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5FB006B879741A02"]
			description: ["Move your towers onto &6UIV SMES Cells&r and the wireless network carries UIV to every station, out to the black hole. One formed tower holding a UIV cell: the network runs at its strongest cell, so until then it stays at UEV. Each wireless hatch also takes a &6Pulsar-Timed Repeater&r (photonic integration hall) to keep the network in step. The wireless hatches at UIV, and the gate's load for UXV. Add cells when the network dips at your busiest hour."]
			icon: "gtceu:uiv_wireless_energy_hatch"
			id: "7099122F58BD069C"
			rewards: [{ id: "38CA6305A7C48B92", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "3AC58E780BA67627", item: "grindless:pulsar_timed_repeater", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5374F987A996106F", item: "gtceu:uiv_wireless_energy_hatch", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7AA1FB43832F3534", item: "gtceu:uiv_wireless_dynamo_hatch", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "The Network Goes UIV"
			x: 11.0d
			y: 37.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7099122F58BD069C"]
			description: ["The gate to UXV holds for sixty seconds at a very high UIV load, and the bank loses five per cent on the way in. Two Mk5 rings and a Penrose engine close the sum; four rings do it without the engine. Tick this box once your bank and rings can carry it."]
			icon: "gtceu:uiv_wireless_energy_hatch"
			id: "122504D2A2BC2235"
			rewards: [{ id: "5E3CF3C809F8C206", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "1D1365413D3CF8BE", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Sixteen Amps of UIV"
			x: 13.0d
			y: 37.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3DA510039E5F310C"]
			description: ["The &6Matrioshka Computer&r is the only place the UIV research is written, and it makes the equation of state chart and the Kerr chart. It runs for a long time on a lot of power, so give it its own tower and a quiet bus. Tick this box once it has made a chart."]
			icon: "gtceu:matrioshka_computer"
			id: "581334FA6F7174C9"
			rewards: [{ id: "1A4E557BE2CFF94E", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			shape: "rsquare"
