		{
			dependencies: ["10002E5C148ECC4B"]
			description: ["The &6Rare Earth Extraction Cascade&r, &6Platinum Plant&r, &6Syngas and Shift Plant&r, &6Methane Pyrolyser&r, &6Europium Reductor&r, &6Aerogel Works&r and &6Fluorspar Kiln&r take a new mode each: niobium split, r-process ash cuts, methanation of fusion ash, shock graphite, rare-earth oxides, positronium aerogel and thorium fluoride. The controllers you own and the ash from the fusion burns. The platinum-group cut, the carbon for diamond and the lanthanides. Each plant hands its product on by pipe; send the spent ash back to its plant."]
