		{
			dependencies: ["1A781FD07AF49721"]
			description: ["Element 120 needs a heavier target and bullet: californium on a wheel, hit by a titanium-50 beam. The &6Superheavy Factory&r irradiates the wheel, then picks the atoms out of the gas. A wheel blank (titanium plates and foils, circuit 21) and californium dust in the hot cell (circuit 12) for the wheel; titanium dust in an assembler (circuit 29) for the oven charge. The factory takes both, an Nb3Sn SRF cavity and helium (circuit 7) for the recoil gas, then an etched membrane (circuit 6) for the atoms. The Element 120 Recoil Record; the wheel is a loop, not a cost per run. Return activated wheels to the hot cell (circuit 11) by ME; keep two wheels."]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "grindless:activated_target_wheel"
			id: "74344BCAC847556C"
			rewards: [{ id: "58CA045D3329DFA3", type: "xp", xp: 220 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
