			title: "Polarised Pellet"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 27.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["57862F697D22D7F2", "54AF39C42293C4E7"]
			description: ["The &6Mk5 Fusion Reactor&r has an octagon of casing round an empty channel, lined with metallic hydrogen coils. It holds a very large buffer and takes sixteen hatches. Two UIV hulls, UIV components, UIV circuits, about 520 UIV fusion casings, 1,350 RHEA casings, 1,000 metallic hydrogen field casings, 80 metallic hydrogen coil blocks and sixteen UIV energy hatches. The ring is too large for one pass of GTM's Terminal, which places about 2,300 per pass, so it takes two. The three polarised burns, and the direct energy converter that turns plasma into power. Build the fuel plant before you light the ring; helium-3 and protons return to their lines."]
			icon: "gtceu:uiv_fusion_reactor"
			id: "72D797E3DDE7ED0E"
			rewards: [{ id: "1FC1422722F775DB", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1A652572858A4F0D", item: "gtceu:uiv_fusion_reactor", type: "item" }
				{ id: "53473C5B47FD0440", item: "grindless:uiv_fusion_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7CDEE0EEBF355CAF", item: "grindless:metallic_hydrogen_coil_block", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Mk5 Fusion Reactor"
			x: 15.5d
			y: 25.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["50ED516A490F0DF7"]
			description: ["A computer built in shells, in nine times Earth's sunlight, running logic that makes barely any heat. The &6Matrioshka Computer&r is where UIV research is written. Two UIV hulls, UIV components, UIV circuits, the UIV casing, about 1,600 RHEA casings, 22 droplet radiator modules and 200 logic tiles. It is too large for one pass of GTM's Terminal, which places about 2,300 per pass, so it takes two. Its chart and research rows run in Mercury orbit. Verified writes, the Kerr and equation of state charts, and the radiators that carry its heat. Logic tiles are among the longest builds here: stock them by ME and send the waste heat to the radiators."]
			icon: "gtceu:matrioshka_computer"
			id: "7E2EF99503F9DB02"
			rewards: [{ id: "79DC492E9F485905", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "3FA8AB714439F04F", item: "gtceu:matrioshka_computer", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5268F067E9039C63", item: "gtceu:uiv_machine_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Matrioshka Computer"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 29.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E2EF99503F9DB02"]
			description: ["Heat has nowhere to go in space but out. Liquid tin droplets falling in free fall carry it away, which only works in orbit. The &6Droplet Radiator Works&r builds the modules. A UIV hull, UIV components and the UIV casing; the modules need no particular place. Radiator modules, and the TPV tiles of the Matrioshka shell. Tin overflow returns to stock; ship modules down by ME."]
			icon: "gtceu:droplet_radiator_works"
			id: "582C5EF34B1CF2D0"
			rewards: [{ id: "1DCB16BA2FB047FA", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
