			x: 13.0d
			y: 29.25d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5A78AB35CB8C52AA"]
			description: ["A tether down to the poles and the star's own electric field carry a little of the crust up. The &6Crust Lift&r is fiction: no tether survives that gravity, and the yield is a game number. A UIV hull, the UIV casing and the neutron star site casing, with a winch. Crust matter, which the Neutron Drip Works takes apart. Nothing here is voided: crust ions and nuclei go to their own tanks."]
			icon: "gtceu:crust_lift"
			id: "3DF069B74A45CB2C"
			rewards: [{ id: "5504CF031F7F42F0", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "750DDD0127C441C3", item: "gtceu:crust_lift", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1D24057E59E72584", item: "gtceu:uiv_machine_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "320D8123FCD97E70", item: "grindless:neutron_star_site_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Crust Lift"
			x: 19.0d
			y: -9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3DF069B74A45CB2C"]
			description: ["A slab of crust, lifted from a star that has no ground. Everything taken from it is contained."]
			icon: "grindless:neutron_star_crust"
			id: "72374D6E027767FB"
			rewards: [{ id: "5B00A8545B0D00AF", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3CB6269E59ABF867", item: "grindless:neutron_star_crust", type: "item" }]
			title: "Neutron Star Crust"
			x: 19.0d
			y: -10.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3DF069B74A45CB2C"]
			description: ["Deep in the crust neutrons leak out between the nuclei. The &6Neutron Drip Works&r takes them away, then cools them into a superfluid and shuts it in a cage: the neutronium pellet, which is fiction, a spoonful of neutron matter held by a field. Pick the separation or cage recipe type. A UIV hull, the UIV casing, the neutron star site casing (about 720), the metallic hydrogen field casing (about 420) and the dilution cryostat casing (about 130), with 24 coil blocks. It measures 21 by 13 by 29. Drip neutrons for the r-process, and the neutronium pellet that the stored proof asks for. Drip neutrons decay if you wait: use them at once. Keep pellets by ME."]
			icon: "gtceu:neutronium_cage"
			id: "3B397C1EFE90548C"
			rewards: [{ id: "7155E482279A087A", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "532BF671E0144206", item: "gtceu:neutronium_cage", type: "item" }
				{ id: "70C3DDD8049E55E8", item: "gtceu:uiv_machine_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "37C5FAF6AC405C0C", item: "grindless:neutron_star_site_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "328BB76964BE6C8C", item: "grindless:mh_field_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5FB0EBBB1B0C6A2A", item: "grindless:dilution_cryostat_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Neutron Drip Works"
			x: 21.5d
			y: -9.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B397C1EFE90548C"]
			description: ["A bucket of free neutrons that will not wait. Use it the moment it arrives."]
			icon: "gtceu:drip_neutrons_bucket"
			id: "17BF788859530203"
			rewards: [{ id: "39FDB6363E92065B", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "53DBA67730407384", item: "gtceu:drip_neutrons_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Drip Neutrons"
			x: 21.5d
			y: -10.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B397C1EFE90548C"]
			description: ["It is not the neutronium of the other mods: it is a pellet of neutron matter. The journey asks for it once; keep one for the hall and one for the stored proof."]
			icon: "grindless:neutronium_pellet"
			id: "39FBA237010D5C97"
			rewards: [{ id: "548ECF5E1DB1674F", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			shape: "circle"
			size: 0.75d
			tasks: [{ id: "105417D1EEAAC26F", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "What the Pellet Is"
			x: 24.0d
			y: -10.75d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B397C1EFE90548C"]
			description: ["The &6Neutronium Compression Hall&r reads the pellets in its bus as parallels, and never uses them up. The mega family adds it at UIV. A UIV hull, the neutron star site casing and a pellet in its bus. Parallel runs of older recipes; its implosion mode keeps the explosive, so switch the mode in its own window first. Pellets stay in the hall; feed the batches by ME."]
			icon: "gtceu:neutronium_compression_hall"
			id: "569C4366D8C6AE1E"
			rewards: [{ id: "1B7B1E6C3D0170F7", type: "xp", xp: 250 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "180288F3784407FC", item: "gtceu:neutronium_compression_hall", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3277FA3E076B0CE0", item: "grindless:neutron_star_site_casing", type: "item" }
			]
