		{
			dependencies: ["3B397C1EFE90548C"]
			description: ["Decompress a bit of crust and the heavy elements are born, as in a kilonova. The &6R-Process Decompressor&r also hits uranium with the same neutrons, for einsteinium and fermium. A UIV hull, the UIV casing and the neutron star site casing, with a neutron guide. The Element 119 Recoil Record, Census II and the sealed kilonova capsule. Sort the output by element; ash goes to the platinum plant."]
			icon: "gtceu:r_process_decompressor"
			id: "1993F92869A4278F"
			rewards: [{ id: "752A42505F5B10F8", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
