			x: 29.0d
			y: 4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5FF5D83E309497C2"]
			description: ["A pulsar blinks hundreds of times a second. The &6X-ray Pulse Profiler&r folds the blinks into a profile and times it against a clock at home. A UIV hull and the UIV casing; it is the observatory step after the UEV pulsar station. Timed profiles, four of which the navigation solution needs. Run it on a loop and send each timed profile on by ME."]
			icon: "gtceu:xray_pulse_profiler"
			id: "5FA8F7F32C81B302"
			rewards: [{ id: "3599E9DCADC81D5E", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
