		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5F1E7272AA2A4023"]
			description: ["The &6Penrose Engine&r drops a sled into the ergosphere. The sled splits, one half falls in and the other comes out with more energy than it took in. The hole spins a little slower. It is fiction. A UIV hull and the UIV casing, with a drop rail; about 1,200 metallic hydrogen field casings, 620 RHEA casings and 64 coil blocks. It fills about one whole pass of GTM's Terminal. Power for the gate load, and the recovered half-sled for the gate store. Sleds by ME; send each recovered half back to the bay for a refit."]
			icon: "gtceu:penrose_engine"
			id: "773D4D794D1EA7A1"
			rewards: [{ id: "5E099A93A33BE6B5", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
