		{
			dependencies: ["7D0E32E5DCAD55A7"]
			description: ["The &6Trenched Oxide Wafer&r is a wafer stage on the way to the Damascene Sin Wafer. Made in the &6Synchrotron&r from the Oxidised Wafer, with PMMA resist, in the cleanroom. The Damascene Sin Wafer in the Chemical Reactor. Chain the machines by ME, and keep a small buffer of this wafer between steps."]
			icon: "grindless:trenched_oxide_wafer"
