		{
			dependencies: ["3784E698A1F76F61"]
			description: ["The &6Damascene Sin Wafer&r is a wafer stage on the way to the Annealed Damascene Ring. Made in the &6Chemical Reactor&r from the Trenched Oxide Wafer, with silane, in the cleanroom. The Annealed Damascene Ring and Quartz Sand in the Photonic Foundry. Stock it by ME and let the next step pull it; nothing here needs a hand."]
