		{
			dependencies: ["7D0E32E5DCAD55A7"]
			description: ["The &6Poled LNOI Wafer&r is a wafer stage on the way to the PPLN Waveguide. Made in the &6Ion Slicing&r from the LNOI Wafer and Gold Foil, in the cleanroom. The PPLN Waveguide and LN On Insulator Plus in the Photonic Foundry. A pattern provider on the machine of the step before keeps it supplied."]
			icon: "grindless:poled_lnoi_wafer"
